# 构建产物、运行文件及冻结原版不进入产品源码
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
backend/storage/
backend/logs/
/logs/
/output/deliverables/
backend/maven-repository/
backend/src/main/resources/static/
verification/baseline-copies/
verification/runtime/
verification/**/*.log
verification/**/*.json.actual
backend/orekit-data/.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.env
.env.*
application-local.yml
*.zip
/.playwright-cli/
## A07仅允许实际命令的原始双流证据；运行服务日志仍按原规则忽略。
!verification/A07/**/*.stdout.log
!verification/A07/**/*.stderr.log
# A17 数值驱动的实际命令日志用于回归复核；运行副本仍全部忽略。
!verification/A17/numeric-*/**/*.log
# A18 数值驱动日志与运行副本分开，实际验证日志进入验收记录。
!verification/A18/numeric-*/**/*.log
